Day 30: Challenge accepted 🤝🏼

Taking on this social media challenge with these two has been an incredible experience. They’ve pushed me in ways I needed, especially when it comes to putting myself out there online—something I’ve always struggled with as a realtor. This challenge has helped me move past the fear of opinions and embrace the process.

Your network is your net worth, and I’m grateful to be surrounded by people who push me to grow. These two are making big moves in real estate, and I’m honored to learn, grow, and level up alongside them! 

@peyson.robertson 
